  "custom_logic_notes": "Bill Williams triple-screen entry system: (1) Alligator mouth must be open (Jaw < Teeth < Lips for uptrend, reversed for downtrend) indicating trend; (2) Fractal breakout confirms entry direction - buy stop placed at upper fractal, sell stop at lower fractal; (3) AO and AC must both be in favorable direction (both green for long, both red for short). Entry uses previous completed bar fractal values (shift 2). Fractal-based stop entries mean the EA places pending orders at fractal breakout levels rather than market orders immediately. Signal reversal exits apply when AO/AC flip signs against the position.",
