  "backtest_data_needs": "H1",
  "python_conversion_notes": "All indicators have direct Python equivalents via talipp or custom calculations. Alligator = 3 smoothed MAs with offsets. Fractals require bar-by-bar comparison of High[2]/Low[2] against neighbors. AO = SMA(median,5) - SMA(median,34). AC = AO - SMA(AO,5). Key challenge: fractal breakout pending order logic requires tracking fractal levels across bars and placing stop orders at those levels. Must implement digit adjustment for SL/TP (multiply by 10 for 5-digit brokers). New bar guard is essential to avoid repeated signal processing. Position gate check (no existing same-side position) must be implemented before fractal breakout entries.",
